0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#why-caching-first","title":"Why caching first"},{"depth":2,"url":"#start-here-or-skip-ahead","title":"Start here, or skip ahead"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-order-to-read-them-in","title":"The order to read them in"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"Getting started"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"The first section of the reading path: a cache running, connected to your build, proven to be hitting."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," anyone who has decided to try Forge and wants the\nshortest path to a real result. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll have at the end of this\nsection:"}]," a cache your build system is talking to, hits you can point at,\nand, if you want it, the same cache shared with your team. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," ten\nminutes for the first win, an afternoon for the shared one."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"data-prerequisites":true,"className":"my-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-5 py-3","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"my-0 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand","children":"Before you start"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground [&>p]:my-0","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"Nothing beyond a build system that speaks the Remote Execution API."}]}]]}],"\n",["$","$L6",null,{"as":"h2","id":"why-caching-first","children":"Why caching first"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Forge does two things: it caches build outputs, and it executes build\nactions remotely. It is tempting to reach for the second one immediately,\nbecause it's the more impressive half. Do the first one first anyway."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Caching is the half with the short feedback loop. You start it, you point\nyour build at it, you build twice, and the second build is faster. The whole\nloop is minutes and nothing about it can fail mysteriously. Remote execution\nadds a scheduler, workers, a platform-matching contract, and a toolchain\nhermeticity requirement, and every one of those is easier to debug when the\nstorage layer underneath is already known-good."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"This section is the first of four on the reading path, and each section\nassumes the one before it is standing:"}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6","children":["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Section"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"You end with"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Getting started"}]," (you are here)"]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"a cache serving hits to your build"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/remote-execution","children":"Remote execution"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"workers running the actions that miss the cache"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/configuration","children":"Configuration"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"a config file you wrote and understand"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/how-to","children":"How-to guides"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"the backend, transport, and upgrade path you want"}]]}]]}]]}]}],"\n",["$","$L6",null,{"as":"h2","id":"start-here-or-skip-ahead","children":"Start here, or skip ahead"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Start here"}]," if Forge isn't running yet. Take\n",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/getting-started/quickstart","children":"Quickstart"}]," in order; it's a guaranteed happy path and\nevery step tells you what output to expect."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Skip ahead"}]," if you already have a cache running and hitting. The next section picks\nyou up at ",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/remote-execution","children":"Remote execution"}]," and assumes exactly this\nsection's outcome and nothing more."]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb"]}],"$Lc"]}],["$Ld","$Le"],"$Lf"]}],"isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$11","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L12","isPartial":"$@13","staleTime":"$11","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L14","isPartial":"$@15","staleTime":"$11","varyParams":"$16"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@17","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@18"}
